'''Cantonese seafood soup''' is one of the main [[seafood]] soups within [[Cantonese cuisine]]. It is commonly found in [[Hong Kong]], and is also available in [[Chinatown]]s in other nations. The soup is usually considered midrange to high-end in price, depending on the ingredients.
